# Docker Compose: http://localhost:8080
# IDE https profile: https://localhost:7166
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Start search
# @name startSearch
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/searches
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "Kyiv"
}

### Get search results
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/searches/{{startSearch.response.body.$.searchId}}